note as N_Shared
  <b>Value objects de Shared que usa Assets</b>
  --
  <b>BusinessId</b>: negocio dueño de los equipos (Company).
  Lo guardan Edge, Device y DeviceNetwork.
  <b>InstallationId</b>: instalación de Soporte Técnico donde
  se monta la red. Lo guarda DeviceNetwork.
  Assets solo guarda sus ids: nunca accede a esos contextos
  directamente.
end note

' ---------- DISPOSICIÓN ----------
RegisterEdgeCommand -[hidden]down- UpdateEdgeCommand
UpdateEdgeCommand -[hidden]down- ChangeEdgeStatusCommand
ChangeEdgeStatusCommand -[hidden]down- MarkEdgeInUseCommand
MarkEdgeInUseCommand -[hidden]down- ReleaseEdgeCommand
RegisterDeviceCommand -[hidden]down- UpdateDeviceCommand
UpdateDeviceCommand -[hidden]down- ChangeDeviceStatusCommand
ChangeDeviceStatusCommand -[hidden]down- MarkDeviceInUseCommand
MarkDeviceInUseCommand -[hidden]down- ReleaseDeviceCommand
CreateDeviceNetworkCommand -[hidden]down- AddEdgeToNetworkCommand
AddEdgeToNetworkCommand -[hidden]down- AddDeviceToNetworkCommand
AddDeviceToNetworkCommand -[hidden]down- RemoveEdgeFromNetworkCommand
RemoveEdgeFromNetworkCommand -[hidden]down- RemoveDeviceFromNetworkCommand
RemoveDeviceFromNetworkCommand -[hidden]down- DeactivateDeviceNetworkCommand
GetEdgeByIdQuery -[hidden]down- GetAllEdgesByBusinessIdQuery
GetAllEdgesByBusinessIdQuery -[hidden]down- ExistsEdgeByMacAddressQuery
ExistsEdgeByMacAddressQuery -[hidden]down- GetEdgeByMacAddressQuery
GetDeviceByIdQuery -[hidden]down- GetAllDevicesByBusinessIdQuery
GetAllDevicesByBusinessIdQuery -[hidden]down- GetAllDevicesByBusinessIdAndStatusQuery
GetAllDevicesByBusinessIdAndStatusQuery -[hidden]down- ExistsDeviceByMacAddressQuery
ExistsDeviceByMacAddressQuery -[hidden]down- GetDeviceByMacAddressQuery
GetDeviceNetworkByIdQuery -[hidden]down- GetDeviceNetworkByInstallationIdQuery
GetDeviceNetworkByInstallationIdQuery -[hidden]down- GetDeviceNetworkByEdgeIdQuery
GetDeviceNetworkByEdgeIdQuery -[hidden]down- GetDeviceNetworkByDeviceIdQuery
GetDeviceNetworkByDeviceIdQuery -[hidden]down- GetEdgeAccessTableQuery
EdgeNotFound -[hidden]down- DeviceNotFound
DeviceNotFound -[hidden]down- DeviceNetworkNotFound
DeviceNetworkNotFound -[hidden]down- InvalidMacAddress
InvalidMacAddress -[hidden]down- MacAddressAlreadyExists
MacAddressAlreadyExists -[hidden]down- BusinessNotFound
AssetNotInBusiness -[hidden]down- InvalidAssetStatusTransition
InvalidAssetStatusTransition -[hidden]down- AssetNotAvailable
AssetNotAvailable -[hidden]down- AssetNotEditable
InvalidNetworkMember -[hidden]down- NodeTypeAlreadyInNetwork
NodeTypeAlreadyInNetwork -[hidden]down- AssetAlreadyInNetwork
AssetAlreadyInNetwork -[hidden]down- AssetNotInNetwork
DeviceNetworkAlreadyExists -[hidden]down- DeviceNetworkDeactivated

' ---------- HERENCIA, COMPOSICIÓN Y REFERENCIAS ----------
Asset <|-- Edge
Asset <|-- Device
Asset "0..*" --> "1" AssetStatus : status
Asset "1" *-- "1" MacAddress : macAddress
Edge "0..*" --> "1" EdgeType : type
Device "0..*" --> "1" DeviceType : type
DeviceNetwork "0..*" --> "1" NetworkStatus : status
DeviceNetwork "0..1" -[#6A1B9A]-> "0..1" Edge : microphoneEdge >
DeviceNetwork "0..1" -[#6A1B9A]-> "0..1" Edge : actuatorEdge >
DeviceNetwork "0..1" -[#6A1B9A]-> "0..1" Device : microphone >
DeviceNetwork "0..1" -[#6A1B9A]-> "0..*" Device : actuators >
DeviceNetwork ..> EdgeAccessTable : tableFor >
EdgeAccessTable "1" *-- "0..*" NodeRef : allowedSources / allowedTargets
NodeRef "0..*" --> "1" NodeType : type
NodeRef "0..*" --> "0..1" DeviceType : deviceType

' ---------- EVENTOS ----------
Asset ..> AssetStatusChangedEvent : registra >
DeviceNetwork ..> AssetAssignedToNetworkEvent : registra >
DeviceNetwork ..> AssetRemovedFromNetworkEvent : registra >
DeviceNetwork ..> AccessTableUpdatedEvent : registra >
AssetAssignedToNetworkEvent ..> MarkEdgeInUseCommand : activa >
AssetAssignedToNetworkEvent ..> MarkDeviceInUseCommand : activa >
AssetRemovedFromNetworkEvent ..> ReleaseEdgeCommand : activa >
AssetRemovedFromNetworkEvent ..> ReleaseDeviceCommand : activa >
AssetStatusChangedEvent ..> RemoveEdgeFromNetworkCommand : activa >
AssetStatusChangedEvent ..> RemoveDeviceFromNetworkCommand : activa >

' ---------- SERVICES ----------
EdgeCommandService ..> RegisterEdgeCommand : recibe >
EdgeCommandService ..> UpdateEdgeCommand : recibe >
EdgeCommandService ..> ChangeEdgeStatusCommand : recibe >
